  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@value" : "individual representing the parliament, council, and other institutions that comprise the government of the European Union"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@value" : "Government of the European Union"
  } ],
  "https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/AnnotationVocabulary/explanatoryNote" : [ {
    "@value" : "In the EU's unique institutional set-up:\n- the EU's broad priorities are set by the European Council, which brings together national and EU-level leaders directly elected MEPs represent European citizens in the European Parliament\n- the interests of the EU as a whole are promoted by the European Commission, whose members are appointed by national governments\n- governments defend their own country's national interests in the Council of the European Union."
  } ],
